content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person requesting and approving vehicle customization"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Request",
      "description": "Description of the customer’s desired vehicle modifications"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Customer’s vehicle that will be customized"
    },
    {
      "name": "Modification",
      "description": "Specific change or enhancement requested for the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Plan",
      "description": "Proposed design including tasks and budget for customization"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Task",
      "description": "Action performed to modify the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget",
      "description": "Estimated cost for the planned customization"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customization Specialist",
      "description": "Expert designing the customization and preparing work orders"
    },
    {
      "name": "Work Order",
      "description": "Document assigning tasks to technicians"
    },
    {
      "name": "Technician",
      "description": "Person performing the customization tasks"
    },
    {
      "name": "Part Depletion Report",
      "description": "Notice that needed parts are missing or running low"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parts Manager",
      "description": "Person responsible for inventory and part orders"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "description": "Collection of available parts for customization work"
    },
    {
      "name": "Part",
      "description": "Component needed for vehicle modifications"
    },
    {
      "name": "Part Order",
      "description": "Request for new parts to restock inventory"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quality Inspector",
      "description": "Person checking the correctness and safety of modifications"
    },
    {
      "name": "Modification Review",
      "description": "Inspection of finished modifications on the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "name": "Completion Approval",
      "description": "Final confirmation that the work order is complete"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Customization Request",
      "description": "Customer creates the Customization Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customization Specialist",
      "to": "Customization Request",
      "description": "Customization Specialist evaluates the Customization Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customization Specialist",
      "to": "Customization Plan",
      "description": "Customization Specialist creates the Customization Plan"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customer",
      "to": "Customization Plan",
      "description": "Customer approves the Customization Plan"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customization Specialist",
      "to": "Work Order",
      "description": "Customization Specialist issues the Work Order"
    },
    {
      "from": "Work Order",
      "to": "Technician",
      "description": "Work Order assigns tasks to the Technician"
    },
    {
      "from": "Technician",
      "to": "Customization Task",
      "description": "Technician performs the Customization Task"
    },
    {
      "from": "Customization Task",
      "to": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Customization Task is applied to the Vehicle"
    },
    {
      "from": "Quality Inspector",
      "to": "Modification Review",
      "description": "Quality Inspector performs the Modification Review"
    },
    {
      "from": "Modification Review",
      "to": "Vehicle",
      "description": "Modification Review evaluates the Vehicle"
    },
    {
      "from": "Quality Inspector",
      "to": "Completion Approval",
      "description": "Quality Inspector issues the Completion Approval"
    },
    {
      "from": "Completion Approval",
      "to": "Work Order",
      "description": "Completion Approval validates the Work Order"
    },
    {
      "from": "Technician",
      "to": "Part Depletion Report",
      "description": "Technician submits the Part Depletion Report"
    },
    {
      "from": "Part Depletion Report",
      "to": "Parts Manager",
      "description": "Part Depletion Report notifies the Parts Manager"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parts Manager",
      "to": "Inventory",
      "description": "Parts Manager updates the Inventory"
    },
    {
      "from": "Parts Manager",
      "to": "Part Order",
      "description": "Parts Manager creates the Part Order"
    }
  ]
}
```
